# This directory is populated by ../../tests/env/generate-kafka-certs.sh,
# which is idempotent and regenerates every file below from scratch if
# missing (test-only CA + per-cluster keystores + the combined truststore
# + the Confluent-image credential files). None of it is hand-authored,
# so none of it belongs in version control — including, especially,
# testenv-ca.key (a CA private key).
#
# The exceptions are kafka-downstream.keystore.jks and
# kafka-downstream.truststore.jks: these ship intentionally with the repo
# as the one pre-existing sample cert pair (see generate-kafka-certs.sh's
# own comment on gen_cluster_keystore), so they're explicitly un-ignored
# below.
*
!.gitignore
!kafka-downstream.keystore.jks
!kafka-downstream.truststore.jks
